      "id": "t003185",
      "source": "N11. Time intervals and overlapping events",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003186",
      "source": "Problem 176. Overlapping historical intervals: case 1",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003187",
      "source": "Knowledge context.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003188",
      "source": "Historical periods often overlap rather than forming a single neat sequence.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003189",
      "source": "Given facts.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003190",
      "source": "Event A lasted from year 100 to 135. Event B lasted from 100 to 128. Treat intervals as continuous for this exercise.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003191",
      "source": "Rules.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003192",
      "source": "Two intervals overlap when max(start times) < min(end times). Overlap length = min(end times) − max(start times), if positive.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003193",
      "source": "Task.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003194",
      "source": "Did the events overlap? If so, for how many years?",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003195",
      "source": "Step-by-step solution.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003196",
      "source": "1. Later start=max(100,100)=100. 2. Earlier end=min(135,128)=128. 3. Difference=128−100=28.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003197",
      "source": "Answer.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003198",
      "source": "Yes, overlap 28 years.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003199",
      "source": "Knowledge takeaway.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003200",
      "source": "Interval reasoning distinguishes “before/after” from “overlapping in time.”",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003201",
      "source": "Formal model.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t003202",
      "source": "Interval intersection; compute max starts and min ends.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
